            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Mantis fights Mantis, and sister battles sister, as more and more join the Fifth Column! There will be blood, but we have hope.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/EzekielLucent_KH2_58.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1283115,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Sardonyx-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The good Mantises can follow the Star Light out of the Shadow. But you must study a brighter light to face the Shadow Queen.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/EzekielLucent_KH2_59.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1283115,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Sardonyx-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "To be truthful, I thought the Solar Arc was a myth. But you have shown me many impossible things. So I delved into the archives.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/EzekielLucent_KH2_60.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1283115,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Sardonyx-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Chronicles say before approaching the Solar Arc one must meditate at the three Fountains of the Land.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/EzekielLucent_KH2_61.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1283115,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Sardonyx-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "However, Balor had the Fountains turned off. Speak to Nadezha, for she knows how to restore them. I will research more!",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/EzekielLucent_KH2_62.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1283115,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
